      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Every Servitor has a pre-programed task to perform. They will continue to operate on their programmed functions until re-programmed with a Hard (−20) Tech (Augmetics) Test. The individual that programmed (or re-programmed) the Servitor can give it simple orders.  Controlled Demo Charge: The Servitor is equipped with a demolition charge (p136 CRB) that can be activated by someone nearby with the correct authorization codes via a dataslate by short range vox-relay. The charge has a range of 200m, requires an Ordinary (+10) Tech test, and has a radius of Short range.</p>"
